# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supervisorly .gitignore
#
# Guiding rule: SOURCE and CONFIG are committed; anything a run PRODUCES is not.
# Scan output contains personal data about real academics (names, emails,
# affiliations), so it must never be committed to a public repository.
# See docs/ethics-and-compliance.md for why this matters.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Scan output: generated per-run, contains personal data -----------------
/output/
/runs/
*.supervisorly-run/
# SQLite is the source of truth but is per-run and holds personal data — never commit (D-005)
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-wal
.cache_tmp/

# --- HTTP + API response cache + page snapshots -----------------------------
# Cached pages / snapshots hold raw personal data (real academics' pages). These are UNANCHORED
# so a scan with a non-default --out (e.g. results/dash.html -> results/.cache/snaps/) still has
# its snapshots ignored — the D-005 guarantee is content-based, not layout-dependent.
.cache/
cache/
**/.cache/
**/snaps/
*.cache.sqlite
*.cache.sqlite-journal

# --- Browser seam state (D-064/065): session metadata + staging --------------
# Pacing state records which social hosts were visited in this login session, and the
# browser staging dir holds extracted page text — both are session data, unanchored so
# the guarantee is content-based, not layout-dependent (D-005).
pacing_state.json
**/pacing_state.json
**/browser_staging/

# --- Secrets ----------------------------------------------------------------
# API keys, the polite-pool contact email, and any provider credentials.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.json
credentials.json

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/

# --- Node / dashboard build --------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
firebase-debug.log*
firebase-debug.*.log
.firebase/
.vite/

# --- Editors and OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Local Claude Code state -------------------------------------------------
# Shared skill/agent definitions ARE committed (that is the point of the repo);
# only machine-local settings are ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json
